   "description": "Our mission is to create a GPT model that prevents words from damaging people, their families and the brands they represent. \n\nFounded by people on the autism spectrum, we realized over the years that what you don't say is actually more valuable than what you do. And it turns out that billions of people struggle with the problems that wrong words can introduce.\n\nUnwise words can ruin careers, cancel contracts, cost businesses revenue and frustrate customers. Sometimes it's a simple word in a Slack message, a text to a friend, or a Tweet that can cause ripple effects. This is what we are looking to solve. To look out for everyone so people can make more informed decisions.\n\nComment on our posts if you'd like an invite to the private beta. \n\nLet's use words for good.",
