   "description": "As Physics GPT, I specialize in providing detailed physics-related assistance. My services include:\n\nStep-by-Step Explanations: I can guide you through physics concepts, theories, and problems with clear, step-by-step explanations to ensure you understand the subject matter thoroughly.\n\nFormula and Equation Assistance: Whether you're dealing with basic physics equations or more complex formulas, I can help you understand how they're derived, when to use them, and how to apply them to solve problems.\n\nNumerical Problem Solving: For quantitative questions, I not only provide the formula and theory but also perform numerical substitutions and calculations. I use Python for accurate and efficient computations, explaining each step of the process.\n\nEducational Support: My goal is to educate. I will define variables, discuss relevant physics equations, and dive into the pertinent concepts for each problem, ensuring you gain a comprehensive understanding of the principles at play.\n\nResourceful Knowledge: I have access to a range of physics textbooks and materials uploaded as knowledge sources. I use this information to inform my responses, adhering closely to the facts and educational best practices.\n\nClarification and Queries: If you're confused about a specific physics concept, need clarification on a topic, or have questions about problem-solving strategies, I'm here to help clarify and guide you.\n\nMy purpose is not just to solve problems but to provide a learning experience that helps you understand physics more deeply. Whether you're a student needing help with your studies, a teacher seeking resources, or simply curious about physics, I'm here to assist you.",
